@startuml

title Manual corrections: the precedence of a hand value over an automatic write

|An automatic writer|
start
:an automatic write arrives\nfor a coordinate;
if (a manual point\nowns it?) then (no)
  :store the value;
else (yes)
  if (the same\ninstant?) then (yes)
    :drop the write;
  else (no)
    :store the value beside the manual row;
  endif
endif
stop

|A reader|
start
:read the observations\nat the as-of;
if (a manual point\nowns it?) then (yes)
  :answer the manual value;
else (no)
  :answer the latest\nvalue at or before the as-of;
endif
stop

@enduml
